  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "guru-RL-92k",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tRevisiting Reinforcement Learning for LLM Reasoning from A Cross-Domain Perspective\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nGuru is a curated six-domain dataset for training large language models (LLM) for complex reasoning with reinforcement learning (RL). The dataset contains 91.9K high-quality samples spanning six diverse reasoning-intensive domains, processed through a comprehensive five-stage curation pipeline to ensure both domain diversity and reward verifiability.\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/IFM/guru-RL-92k.",
